Q1. Your company purchases 100 Samsung Chargers at ₹1,000 each from Samsung Korea. For purchase, you make 10% payment. Use new reference and against reference concept while recording this voucher.
Invoice Number – SK001
Step 1: Record Purchase
1. Open Tally Prime.
2. Go to Gateway of Tally.
3. Select Vouchers.
4. Press F9: Purchase.
5. Press Ctrl + H → Select Voucher Mode.
Step 2: Create the Required Ledgers
- Samsung Chargers → Under: Purchase A/c
- Samsung Korea → Under: Sundry Creditors
Enter the Transaction
Debit: Samsung Chargers — ₹1,00,000
Credit: Samsung Korea — ₹1,00,000
Step 3: Enter Bill-wise Details for Samsung Korea
- Type of Ref: New Ref
- Name: SK001
- Amount: ₹1,00,000
Step 4: Enter the Narration
Being purchase of Samsung chargers from Samsung Korea against Invoice No. SK001.
Press Ctrl + A to save.
B. Make 10% Payment
Step 1: Open Payment Voucher
1. Go to Gateway of Tally.
2. Select Vouchers.
3. Press F5: Payment.
4. Press Ctrl + H → Select Voucher Mode.
Step 2: Enter the Transaction
Debit: Samsung Korea — ₹10,000
Credit: HDFC Bank — ₹10,000
Step 3: Bill-wise Details
- Type of Ref: Agst Ref
- Select: SK001
- Amount: ₹10,000
Step 4: Enter the Narration
Being 10% payment made to Samsung Korea against Invoice No. SK001.
Press Ctrl + A to save.

